<title>USA: Auburn, Wash., yields 5.47 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Auburn, Wash., yields 5.47 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it repriced $5 million of Auburn, Wash., utility system revenue bonds, 1997 with a top yield of 5.47 percent in 2016.</p>
